[32m+[m[32m## Phase 10B Live Monitoring Engine[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPhase 10B adds an isolated synthetic live monitoring engine for demo and judging flows. It does not require Windows Event Log access and does not modify the existing Streamlit event-ingestion workflow.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mHow it works:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Generates synthetic events continuously from existing scenario generation logic.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Reuses the existing detection engine, alert correlation, incident classification, Analyst, and Defender recommendation flow.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Keeps state in memory (events, alerts, incidents, status, playback speed).[m
[32m+[m[32m- Exposes dedicated API endpoints under `/api/v1/live/*`:[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `GET /api/v1/live/status`[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `POST /api/v1/live/start`[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `POST /api/v1/live/pause`[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `POST /api/v1/live/resume`[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `POST /api/v1/live/reset`[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `GET /api/v1/live/events`[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `GET /api/v1/live/alerts`[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `GET /api/v1/live/incidents`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSupported live demo scenarios:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Multi Stage Intrusion[m
[32m+[m[32m- Ransomware[m
[32m+[m[32m- Insider Threat[m
[32m+[m[32m- Credential Attack[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPlayback speeds:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- `0.5x`, `1x`, `2x`, `5x`, `10x`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mHow judges use it:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Open the Streamlit **Live Monitoring** page.[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Select a scenario and playback speed.[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Click **Start** and observe event, alert, incident, MITRE, and pipeline panels auto-refresh every second.[m
[32m+[m[32m4. Use **Pause**, **Resume**, and **Reset** controls to verify deterministic monitor behavior.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mWhy this is isolated:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- It uses synthetic records only and never reads or requires real host telemetry.[m
[32m+[m[32m- It runs independently of `database/raven_soc.db` and does not perform real containment actions.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Analyst metadata is sanitized; raw model output is not exposed.[m
